<title>UK: Nomura sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it has issued 250,000 European-style call warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    21,278.25 YEN	   CAP LEVEL    23,304.75</p>
<p> YEB</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $5.03</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  20,265 YEN</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
